    <a href="index.html" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; background: #f1f5f9; color: var(--primary); border: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 7px 13px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none;">🏠 返回主页</a>
